<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the engine control computer.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the camshaft timing oil control valve assembly connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal of the engine control computer and the camshaft timing oil control valve assembly vehicle side connector. (see <xref href="X39400000QV016D" label="Seep01"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
